sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Policy Contract
  participant B as Beacon
  participant C as Sampled Custodian
  participant V as Audit Verifier
  P->>P: Commit epoch roster, commitments, domains
  B-->>P: Unpredictable epoch seed
  P->>P: Sample s custodians
  P-->>C: Canonical HashToGroup canary X, context, deadline
  C-->>V: D_i = Y^x_i plus DLEQ proof
  V->>V: Verify membership, proof, uniqueness, context
  V-->>P: Valid/invalid response commitment
  P->>P: Finalize at deadline; mark missing responses
  P-->>P: Audit result and accountability evidence
